      "content": "hey so im on sertraline for my anxiety (been taking it for like 2 years now) but i messed up my back at the gym and it hurts like crazy. my doctor mentioned tramadol but i havent gotten the script yet. is it okay if i just pick some up or take it with my zoloft? i dont want to wait a week for an appointment if i can just deal with it now",
